Package: gRs
Title: Process and Analyse Environmental Data from esdat and EQuIS
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("James", "Enright", , "jamesenright43@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Convenience functions to read surface water, groundwater and
    soil chemistry exports from esdat and EQuIS, normalise them to a shared
    set of column names, compare results against action levels, summarise
    them, and test them for trends.
URL: https://github.com/jenright-git/gRs, https://jenright-git.github.io/gRs/
BugReports: https://github.com/jenright-git/gRs/issues
